id: flash-rate
section: The suite's own
item: The content rate is reported apart from the composite rate, and on a generated movie reads within 5 % of the rate the movie itself counts
shells: enyo mochi mojo
page: http://192.168.1.245:8077/jihad-flash-instr.html?swf=jihad-plant-rate10.swf
kit: cavekit-flash.md R2
wait rect m 30
dwell 3000
expect flash-rate-report m 8
launch http://192.168.1.245:8077/jihad-flash-instr.html?swf=jihad-plant-rate15.swf
wait rect m 10
expect flash-rate-report m 8
